<title>SWEDEN: Ericsson wins 1.4 bln SKR Japan order.</title>
<headline>Ericsson wins 1.4 bln SKR Japan order.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish telecoms giant Ericsson on Monday said it had won a mobile telephone order worth 1.4 billion crowns ($208.7 million) from Tokyo Digital Phone.</p>
<p>Tokyo Digital Phone is one of three licenced operators that make up the Digital Phone Group. ($1=6.708 Swedish Crown)</p>
